><td class="num">6</td></tr><tr><td class="num">4</td><td>Antoine Griezmann</td><td>Atletico Madrid</td><td class="num"><strong>16</strong></td><td class="num">7</td></tr><tr><td class="num">5</td><td>Robert Lewandowski</td><td>Barcelona</td><td class="num"><strong>15</strong></td><td class="num">5</td></tr><tr><td class="num">6</td><td>Alvaro Morata</td><td>Atletico Madrid</td><td class="num"><strong>15</strong></td><td class="num">3</td></tr><tr><td class="num">7</td><td>Vinicius Junior</td><td>Real Madrid</td><td class="num"><strong>15</strong></td><td class="num">5</td></tr><tr><td class="num">8</td><td>Iago Aspas</td><td>Celta Vigo</td><td class="num"><strong>14</strong></td><td class="num">4</td></tr><tr><td class="num">9</td><td>Joselu</td><td>Real Madrid</td><td class="num"><strong>13</strong></td><td class="num">3</td></tr><tr><td class="num">10</td><td>Savio</td><td>Girona</td><td class="num"><strong>11</strong></td><td class="num">10</td></tr></tbody></table></div></section> <section class="section" id="assists"><h2 class="section-title">Top Assisters</h2><div class="table-wrap" role="region" aria-label="Top assisters table" tabindex="0"><table class="stats-table" aria-label="Top assisters"><thead><tr><th class="num" scope="col">#</th><th scope="col">Player</th><th scope="col">Club</th><th class="num" scope="col">Assists</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="num">1</td><td>Savio</td><td>Girona</td><td class="num"><strong>10</strong></td></tr><tr><td class="num">2</td><td>Artem Dovbyk</td><td>Girona</td><td class="num"><strong>8</strong></td></tr><tr><td class="num">3</td><td>Antoine Griezmann</td><td>Atletico Madrid</td><td class="num"><strong>7</strong></td></tr><tr><td class="num">4</td><td>Jude Bellingham</td><td>Real Madrid</td><td class="num"><strong>6</strong></td></tr><tr><td class="num">5</td><td>Vinicius Junior</td><td>Real Madrid</td><td class="num"><strong>5</strong></td></tr></tbody></table></div></section> <section class="section" id="clean-sheets"><h2 class="section-title">Clean Sheet Leaders</h2><div class="table-wrap" role="region" aria-label="Clean sheet leaders table" tabindex="0"><table class="stats-table" aria-label="Clean sheet leaders"><thead><tr><th class="num" scope="col">#</th><th scope="col">Goalkeeper</th><th scope="col">Club</th><th class="num" scope="col">Clean Sheets</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class="num">1</td><td>Unai Simon</td><td>Athletic Bilbao</td><td class="num"><strong>14</strong></td></tr><tr><td class="num">2</td><td>Marc-Andre ter Stegen</td><td>Barcelona</td><td class="num"><strong>13</strong></td></tr><tr><td class="num">3</td><td>Andriy Lunin</td><td>Real Madrid</td><td class="num"><strong>12</strong></td></tr><tr><td class="num">4</td><td>Alex Remiro</td><td>Real Sociedad</td><td class="num"><strong>11</strong></td></tr><tr><td class="num">5</td><td>Jan Oblak</td><td>Atletico Madrid</td><td class="num"><strong>10</strong></td></tr></tbody></table></div></section> <div class="section"><h2 class="section-title">Season Awards</h2><div class="awards-grid"><div class="award-card"><div class="award-title">Player of the Season</div><div class="award-winner">Jude Bellingham</div></div><div class="award-card"><div class="award-title">Pichichi (Top Scorer)</div><div class="award-winner">Artem Dovbyk</div></div><div class="award-card"><div class="award-title">Best Goalkeeper</div><div class="award-winner">Unai Simon</div></div><div class="award-card"><div class="award-title">Best Coach</div><div class="award-winner">Michel (Girona)</div></div></div></div> <section class="section" id="review"> <h2 class="section-title">Season Review</h2> <div class="narrative"> <p>Real Madrid reclaimed the La Liga title in 2023-24, finishing on 91 points in what proved to be a season of surprises and storylines that captivated Spanish football from August to May.</p><p>The headline act was Jude Bellingham. The young Englishman, signed from Borussia Dortmund for over 100 million euros, delivered one of the most remarkable debut seasons in La Liga history. With 19 league goals, many of them late winners, Bellingham became the heartbeat of Carlo Ancelotti&#39;s side and was named the league&#39;s Player of the Season.</p><p>But perhaps the greatest story of the campaign belonged to Girona. Michel&#39;s side, competing in only their second ever top-flight season, finished a stunning third on 81 points, qualifying for the Champions League for the first time in the club&#39;s history. Ukrainian striker Artem Dovbyk was the driving force, scoring 24 goals to claim the Pichichi trophy as La Liga&#39;s top scorer. Brazilian winger Savio provided 10 assists, making Girona&#39;s attack one of the most potent in the division.</p><p>Barcelona endured a frustrating campaign by their standards. Despite finishing second on 85 points, Xavi Hernandez&#39;s side never truly threatened Real Madrid&#39;s march to the title. Robert Lewandowski managed 15 goals, a notable drop from his debut season tally, and the club&#39;s inconsistency in big matches proved costly. Xavi announced his departure before later reversing the decision, adding further turbulence to a difficult year.</p><p>Atletico Madrid secured fourth place under Diego Simeone, with Antoine Griezmann and Alvaro Morata combining for 31 goals. Athletic Bilbao enjoyed a fine season, finishing fifth and qualifying for the Europa League under Ernesto Valverde, while also winning the Copa del Rey for the first time in 40 years.</p><p>At the bottom, newly promoted Granada and Almeria both finished on just 21 points, going straight back down. Cadiz joined them in relegation with 33 points, unable to find consistency throughout the campaign.</p><p>Alexander Sorloth deserves mention for his outstanding campaign at Villarreal, netting 23 goals to finish second in the scoring charts. The Norwegian&#39;s form earned him a summer move to Atletico Madrid.</p><p>A season that saw Real Madrid add the Champions League to their domestic crown, witnessed the rise of a provincial fairy tale in Girona, and produced one of the most exciting debut campaigns in league history through Bellingham -- the 2023-24 La Liga season delivered drama at every turn.</p> </div> </section> <div class="section"> <h2 class="section-title">Relegation & Promotion</h2> <div class="transfer-section"> <div class="transfer-box relegated"> <h4>Relegated</h4> <ul> <li>Granada</li><li>Almeria</li><li>Cadiz</li> </ul> </div> <div class="transfer-box promoted"> <h4>Promoted (replacing)</h4> <ul> <li>Leganes</li><li>Real Valladolid</li><li>Espanyol</li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> <section class="section"> <h2 class="section-title">Notable Moments</h2> <ul class="moments-list"> <li>Jude Bellingham scored 19 league goals in a sensational debut season at Real Madrid</li><li>Girona qualified for the Champions League for the first time in their history</li><li>Artem Dovbyk won the Pichichi trophy with 24 goals in his debut La Liga campaign</li><li>Athletic Bilbao won the Copa del Rey for the first time in 40 years</li><li>Real Madrid completed the La Liga and Champions League double</li> </ul> </section>  <nav class="season-nav" aria-label="Season navigation"> <a href="/la-liga/2022-23/">&larr; 2022-23</a> <a href="/la-liga/">All La Liga seasons</a> <a href="/la-liga/2025-26/">2025-26 &rarr;</a> </nav> </div>  </main> <footer class="site-footer" role="contentinfo"> <div class="container"> <div class="footer-grid"> <div class="footer-brand"> <a href="/" class="site-logo" style="color:#fff;font-size:1.1rem;"> <img class="logo-mark" src="/brand-mark.svg" alt="" width="34" height="34"> <span class="logo-text">last<span>season</span></span> </a> <p>Historical football data archived. Final tables, top scorers, season reviews for leagues across Europe and beyond.</p> </div> <div> <div class="footer-heading">Leagues</div> <ul class="footer-link-list"> <li><a href="/premier-league/">Premier League</a></li> <li><a href="/championship/">Championship</a></li> <li><a href="/la-liga/">La Liga</a></li> <li><a href="/bundesliga/">Bundesliga</a></li> <li><a href="/serie-a/">Serie A</a></li> <li><a href="/ligue-1/">Ligue 1</a></li> </ul> </div> <div> <div class="footer-heading">Site</div> <ul class="footer-link-list"> <li><a href="/tools/">Interactive Tools</a></li> <li><a href="/fantasy-football/">Fantasy Football Helpers</a></li> <li><a href="/daily/">Daily Football Game</a></li> <li><a href="/games/">More Football Games</a></li> <li><a href="/on-this-day/">On This Day</a></li> <li><a href="/my/">My Last Season</a></li> <li><a href="/scores/">Latest Scores & Fixtures</a></li> <li><a href="/compare/">Season Comparisons</a></li> <li><a href="/football-shirts/">Football Shirt Buying Guide</a></li> <li><a href="/search/">Search</a></li> <li><a href="/kits/">Kit Colour Archive</a></li> <li><a href="/records/">Records & Stats</a></li> <li><a href="/faq/">Football FAQ</a></li> <li><a href="/clubs/">All Clubs</a></li> <li><a href="/players/">All Players</a></li> </ul> </div> <div> <div class="footer-heading">Trust</div> <ul class="footer-link-list"> <li><a href="/about/">About</a></li> <li><a href="/methodology/">Methodology & Sources</a></li> <li><a href="/corrections/">Corrections</a></li> <li><a href="/partners/">Data & Partnerships</a></li> <li><a href="/terms/">Terms of Use</a></li> <li><a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a></li> <li><a href="/cookies/">Cookie Policy</a></li> <li><button class="footer-choice-button" type="button" data-reset-analytics>Privacy choices</button></li> </ul> </div> </div> <div class="footer-bottom"> <p class="footer-legal">&copy; 2026 lastseason.co.uk</p> <p class="footer-legal">Independent football archive. Corrections are welcomed and logged.</p> </div> </div> </footer> <aside class="privacy-choice" id="privacy-choice" hidden aria-label="Privacy choices" aria-live="polite"> <div> <strong>Your privacy choices</strong> <p>We use optional, privacy-conscious analytics to understand which archive pages are useful. No advertising trackers are loaded.</p> <a href="/cookies/">Cookie details</a> </div> <div class="privacy-choice-actions"> <button type="button" data-analytics-choice="denied">Reject analytics</button> <button type="button" class="privacy-accept" data-analytics-choice="granted">Allow analytics</button> </div> </aside> <script>
      const toggle = document.getElementById("nav-toggle");
      const nav = document.getElementById("mobile-nav");
      if (toggle && nav) {
        toggle.addEventListener("click", () => {
          const open = nav.classList.toggle("is-open");
          toggle.setAttribute("aria-expanded", String(open));
          document.body.classList.toggle("nav-open", open);
        });
      }

      const searchDrawer = document.getElementById("search-drawer");
      const globalSearch = document.getElementById("global-search");
      const openSearch = () => {
        if (!searchDrawer) return;
        searchDrawer.hidden = false;
        document.body.classList.add("search-open");
        requestAnimationFrame(() => globalSearch?.focus());
      };
      const closeSearch = () => {
        if (!searchDrawer) return;
        searchDrawer.hidden = true;
        document.body.classList.remove("search-open");
      };
      document.querySelectorAll("[data-search-toggle]").forEach((button) => button.addEventListener("click", openSearch));
      document.querySelectorAll("[data-search-close]").forEach((button) => button.addEventListener("click", closeSearch));
      document.addEventListener("keydown", (event) => {
        if (event.key === "Escape") {
          closeSearch();
          nav?.classList.remove("is-open");
          toggle?.setAttribute("aria-expanded", "false");
          document.body.classList.remove("nav-open");
        }
        if (event.key === "/" && !event.metaKey && !event.ctrlKey && !event.altKey && !["INPUT", "TEXTAREA", "SELECT"].includes(document.activeElement?.tagName || "")) {
          event.preventDefault(); openSearch();
        }
      });

      const pagePath = document.body.dataset.pagePath;
      const pageTitle = document.body.dataset.pageTitle;
      if (pagePath && pagePath !== "/" && pageTitle) {
        try {
          const key = "lastseason-history";
          const history = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(key) || "[]").filter((item) => item.path !== pagePath);
          history.unshift({ path: pagePath, title: pageTitle, visitedAt: Date.now() });
          localStorage.setItem(key, JSON.stringify(history.slice(0, 6)));
        } catch {}
      }

      const favouriteKey = "lastseason-favourite-leagues";
      const readFavourites = () => {
        try { return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(favouriteKey) || "[]"); } catch { return []; }
      };
      const syncFavouriteButtons = () => {
        const favourites = readFavourites();
        document.querySelectorAll("[data-favourite-league]").forEach((button) => {
          const active = favourites.includes(button.dataset.favouriteLeague);
          button.setAttribute("aria-pressed", String(active));
          button.classList.toggle("is-favourite", active);
          const label = active ? "Remove from my leagues" : "Save to my leagues";
          button.setAttribute("aria-label", label);
          const text = button.querySelector("[data-favourite-label]");
          if (text) text.textContent = active ? "Saved" : "Save league";
        });
      };
      document.querySelectorAll("[data-favourite-league]").forEach((button) => button.addEventListener("click", () => {
        const favourites = readFavourites();
        const slug = button.dataset.favouriteLeague;
        const next = favourites.includes(slug) ? favourites.filter((item) => item !== slug) : [...favourites, slug];
        try { localStorage.setItem(favouriteKey, JSON.stringify(next)); } catch {}
        syncFavouriteButtons();
        document.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent("lastseason:favourites"));
      }));
      syncFavouriteButtons();

      const favouriteClubKey = "lastseason-favourite-clubs";
      const readFavouriteClubs = () => {
        try { return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(favouriteClubKey) || "[]"); } catch { return []; }
      };
      const syncFavouriteClubButtons = () => {
        const favourites = readFavouriteClubs();
        document.querySelectorAll("[data-favourite-club]").forEach((button) => {
          const active = favourites.includes(button.dataset.favouriteClub);
          button.setAttribute("aria-pressed", String(active));
          button.classList.toggle("is-favourite", active);
          const text = button.querySelector("[data-favourite-club-label]");
          if (text) text.textContent = active ? "Following" : (button.dataset.clubName ? `Follow ${button.dataset.clubName}` : "Follow club");
        });
      };
      document.querySelectorAll("[data-favourite-club]").forEach((button) => button.addEventListener("click", () => {
        const favourites = readFavouriteClubs();
        const slug = button.dataset.favouriteClub;
        const next = favourites.includes(slug) ? favourites.filter((item) => item !== slug) : [...favourites, slug];
        try { localStorage.setItem(favouriteClubKey, JSON.stringify(next)); } catch {}
        syncFavouriteClubButtons();
      }));
      syncFavouriteClubButtons();
      document.querySelectorAll(".table-wrap").forEach(wrap => {
        const check = () => wrap.classList.toggle("is-scrollable", wrap.scrollWidth > wrap.clientWidth + 2);
        check();
        window.addEventListener("resize", check);
      });

      const analyticsKey = "lastseason-analytics-choice";
      const analyticsVisitorKey = "lastseason-analytics-visitor";
      const privacyChoice = document.getElementById("privacy-choice");
      let firstPartyPageViewSent = false;
      const fantasyCompletionEvents = new Set([
        "fantasy_name_copy",
        "fantasy_name_save",
        "fantasy_name_share",
        "fantasy_league_name_save",
        "fantasy_squad_generate",
        "fantasy_plan_save",
        "fantasy_squad_download",
        "fantasy_reminder_download",
      ]);
      const analyticsAllowed = () => {
        try { return localStorage.getItem(analyticsKey) === "granted"; } catch { return false; }
      };
      const analyticsVisitorId = () => {
        if (!analyticsAllowed()) return "";
        try {
          let id = localStorage.getItem(analyticsVisitorKey);
          if (!/^[a-zA-Z0-9-]{16,64}$/.test(id || "")) {
            id = typeof crypto.randomUUID === "function"
              ? crypto.randomUUID()
              : `${Date.now()}-${Math.random().toString(36).slice(2)}-${Math.random().toString(36).slice(2)}`;
            localStorage.setItem(analyticsVisitorKey, id);
          }
          return id;
        } catch {
          return "";
        }
      };
      const sendFirstPartyEvent = (eventName, parameters = {}) => {
        const visitorId = analyticsVisitorId();
        if (!visitorId) return false;
        const eventId = typeof crypto.randomUUID === "function"
          ? crypto.randomUUID()
          : `${Date.now()}-${Math.random().toString(36).slice(2)}-${Math.random().toString(36).slice(2)}`;
        const body = JSON.stringify({
          eventId,
          eventName,
          visitorId,
          pagePath: window.location.pathname,
          parameters,
        });
        try {
          fetch("/api/analytics", {
            method: "POST",
            headers: { "content-type": "application/json" },
            body,
            keepalive: true,
          }).catch(() => {});
          return true;
        } catch {
          return false;
        }
      };
      window.lsTrack = (eventName, parameters = {}) => {
        const eventParameters = {
          page_path: window.location.pathname,
          page_title: document.body.dataset.pageTitle || document.title,
          ...parameters,
        };
        const firstPartySent = sendFirstPartyEvent(eventName, parameters);
        const googleReady = typeof window.gtag === "function" && analyticsAllowed();
        if (googleReady) window.gtag("event", eventName, eventParameters);
        if (fantasyCompletionEvents.has(eventName)) {
          const completionParameters = {
            ...eventParameters,
            completion_type: eventName,
          };
          sendFirstPartyEvent("fantasy_tool_complete", completionParameters);
          if (googleReady) window.gtag("event", "fantasy_tool_complete", completionParameters);
        }
        return firstPartySent || googleReady;
      };
      const loadAnalytics = () => {
        if (!document.querySelector('script[data-lastseason-analytics]')) {
          window.dataLayer = window.dataLayer || [];
          window.gtag = function(){ window.dataLayer.push(arguments); };
          window.gtag("js", new Date());
          window.gtag("config", "G-C2K4PMZEDJ", {
            anonymize_ip: true,
            page_location: window.location.href,
            page_path: window.location.pathname + window.location.search,
            page_title: document.title,
          });
          const script = document.createElement("script");
          script.async = true;
          script.dataset.lastseasonAnalytics = "true";
          script.src = "https://www.googletagmanager.com/gtag/js?id=G-C2K4PMZEDJ";
          document.head.appendChild(script);
        }
        if (!firstPartyPageViewSent) {
          firstPartyPageViewSent = true;
          sendFirstPartyEvent("page_view");
        }
      };
      let analyticsChoice = null;
      try { analyticsChoice = localStorage.getItem(analyticsKey); } catch {}
      if (analyticsChoice === "granted") loadAnalytics();
      if (!analyticsChoice && privacyChoice) privacyChoice.hidden = false;
      document.querySelectorAll("[data-analytics-choice]").forEach((button) => {
        button.addEventListener("click", () => {
          const choice = button.getAttribute("data-analytics-choice");
          try { localStorage.setItem(analyticsKey, choice); } catch {}
          if (choice === "granted") loadAnalytics();
          else {
            try { localStorage.removeItem(analyticsVisitorKey); } catch {}
            if (typeof window.gtag === "function") window.gtag("consent", "update", { analytics_storage: "denied" });
          }
          if (privacyChoice) privacyChoice.hidden = true;
        });
      });
      document.querySelectorAll("[data-reset-analytics]").forEach((button) => {
        button.addEventListener("click", () => {
          try {
            localStorage.removeItem(analyticsKey);
            localStorage.removeItem(analyticsVisitorKey);
          } catch {}
          if (typeof window.gtag === "function") window.gtag("consent", "update", { analytics_storage: "denied" });
          if (privacyChoice) privacyChoice.hidden = false;
        });
      });

      document.addEventListener("click", (event) => {
        const link = event.target instanceof Element
          ? event.target.closest("a[data-affiliate-partner], a[data-retailer][data-affiliate='true']")
          : null;
        if (!(link instanceof HTMLAnchorElement)) return;
        const destination = new URL(link.href, window.location.href);
        const partner = link.dataset.affiliatePartner || link.dataset.retailer || "unknown";
        const context = link.dataset.affiliateContext || link.dataset.commerceContext || "unspecified";
        const placement = link.dataset.affiliatePlacement || context;
        const parameters = {
          affiliate_partner: partner,
          affiliate_placement: placement,
          affiliate_context: context,
          affiliate_club: link.dataset.affiliateClub || "not-applicable",
          destination_host: destination.hostname,
          destination_path: destination.pathname,
          affiliate_link: true,
        };
        window.lsTrack?.("retailer_click", {
          ...parameters,
          retailer: partner,
          commerce_context: context,
        });
      });

      const fantasyActions = {
        "generate-squad": "fantasy_squad_generate",
        "save-squad": "fantasy_plan_save",
        "share-squad": "fantasy_squad_share",
        "download-squad": "fantasy_squad_download",
        "save-chips": "fantasy_plan_save",
        "save-transfer": "fantasy_plan_save",
        "regenerate-kit": "fantasy_mini_league_generate",
        "copy-kit": "fantasy_mini_league_copy",
      };
      document.addEventListener("click", (event) => {
        const element = event.target instanceof Element ? event.target.closest("a,button") : null;
        if (!element) return;
        const action = element.id ? fantasyActions[element.id] : null;
        if (action) window.lsTrack?.(action, { control_id: element.id });
        if (element instanceof HTMLAnchorElement && element.pathname.endsWith(".ics")) {
          window.lsTrack?.("fantasy_reminder_download", { reminder: element.pathname });
        }
        if (element instanceof HTMLAnchorElement && window.location.pathname.startsWith("/fantasy-football/") && element.pathname.startsWith("/fantasy-football/")) {
          window.lsTrack?.("fantasy_internal_click", { destination: element.pathname });
          if (element.pathname === "/fantasy-football/pro/") {
            window.lsTrack?.("fantasy_pro_cta_click", {
              source: "internal_link",
              destination: element.pathname,
            });
          }
        }
      });

      if (window.location.pathname.startsWith("/fantasy-football/")) {
        const seenDepths = new Set();
        const measureDepth = () => {
          const available = document.documentElement.scrollHeight - window.innerHeight;
          if (available <= 0) return;
          const depth = Math.round((window.scrollY / available) * 100);
          [50, 90].forEach((threshold) => {
            if (depth >= threshold && !seenDepths.has(threshold)) {
              seenDepths.add(threshold);
              window.lsTrack?.("fantasy_content_depth", { percent_scrolled: threshold });
            }
          });
        };
        window.addEventListener("scroll", measureDepth, { passive: true });
      }
    </script> <script type="module" src="https://static.cloudflareinsights.com/beacon.min.js/v31edd6df95cf4e85bb4c19e7a9bdbcba1788362987495" integrity="sha512-iIg7k2xntmwu6/uSb5tpc/hySgZc4eoL31yB29W6tJFo2akwjPWcEqnCEdJvGexCL0KEQwVYv5BlowfhVz26hg==" data-cf-beacon='{"version":"2024.11.0","token":"d492c18bc5c9475588c0652aa6345e0f","r":1,"spa":2}' crossorigin="anonymous"></script>
</body> </html>